            "review_title": "Review at Goc Ha Thanh",
            "review_text": "VancouverGinger\nSurrey, Canada171 contributions\n0\nNot the best in Hanoi's French Quarter\nMar 2018 • Couples\nWe stopped for lunch at the Goc and found the meals to be quite average at best. I ordered the beef cabbage meal and the \"cabbage\" seemed more like celery than cabbage. The waitress assured me it was cabbage, however, communication was a problem throughout our meal. Other meals were average as well, with all in the group agreeing that the french fries were the best part. We sat outside in the courtyard but can't say there was much ambiance.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 10, 2018",
